# Link: Real-Time Communication Platform

A modern, full-stack messaging platform engineered for seamless text, media, and video communication. Built with scalable web technologies, **Link** delivers real-time performance for both individual and group interactions.

---

## Core Capabilities

* **Instant Messaging:** Real-time text transmission, chat history persistence, read receipts, and multimedia sharing (images, videos, documents).
* **Ephemeral Stories:** Share temporary text, image, or custom media updates that automatically expire after 24 hours with granular privacy controls.
* **WebRTC Video Calls:** High-definition audio/video calls supporting one-on-one and group sessions with in-call controls (mute, video toggle).
* **User Management:** Secure JWT authentication, custom profiles (avatars, bio), contact syncing, and group management.
* **Real-Time Push Notifications:** Instant notifications for incoming messages, call requests, and status updates.

---

## Technical Stack

* **Frontend:** React, Tailwind CSS / UI Libraries
* **Backend:** Node.js, Express.js
* **Real-Time Engine:** Socket.io / WebSockets, WebRTC
* **Database & Storage:** MongoDB Atlas
* **Authentication:** JSON Web Tokens (JWT)

---

